[PHP]Закрытые раздачи
========================================================
Открыть index.php и найти: -----------------------------

$lastvisit = (IS_GUEST) ? TIMENOW : $userdata['user_lastvisit'];

После этого добавить: ----------------------------------

$closed_release = isset($_GET['closed']) ? $_GET['closed'] : 0;

if ($bb_cfg['closed_release']['on'] && $closed_release)
{
    $start = isset($_GET['start']) ? abs(intval($_GET['start'])) : 0;
    $per_page = $bb_cfg['closed_release']['max_topic_page'];

    $count_topic = DB()->fetch_row("SELECT COUNT(topic_id) AS topic FROM ". BB_BT_TORRENTS ." WHERE tor_status IN (". TOR_CLOSED_CPHOLD .")");

    $closed_release = DB()->fetch_rowset("SELECT
        tor.info_hash, tor.topic_id, tor.size, tor.tor_status, tor.checked_time,
        t.topic_id, t.topic_title
    FROM ". BB_BT_TORRENTS ." tor
    LEFT JOIN ". BB_TOPICS ." t ON (t.topic_id = tor.topic_id)
    WHERE tor.tor_status IN (". TOR_CLOSED_CPHOLD .")
    LIMIT $start, $per_page");

    foreach($closed_release as $row)
    {
        $template->assign_block_vars('closed', array(
            'TOPIC_TITLE'        => $row['topic_title'],
            'SIZE'                => humn_size($row['size']),
            'TIME_STOPED'        => bb_date($row['checked_time'], 'd-M-y'),
            'HASH'                => '<span style="text-transform: uppercase;">'. bin2hex($row['info_hash']) .'</span>'
        ));
    }

    $template->assign_vars(array(
        'PAGINATION'  => generate_pagination(BB_ROOT .'index.php?closed=1', $count_topic['topic'], $per_page, $start),
    ));

    print_page('closed.tpl', 'simple', 'no_header');
}

Открыть config.php в конец добавить: -------------------------

$bb_cfg['closed_release'] = array(
    'on'                => true,
    'max_topic_page'    => 100,
);

Открыть index.tpl и найти: -----------------------------------

        <a href="{U_SEARCH_LATEST}" class="med">{L_SEARCH_LATEST}</a>

Заменить на: -------------------------------------------------

        <a href="{U_SEARCH_LATEST}" class="med">{L_SEARCH_LATEST}</a> &#0183;
        <a href="{U_INDEX}?closed=1" class="med">Закрытые раздачи</a>
И закинуть файл closed.tpl в свой шаблон! [/PHP]
[/SPOILER]
